node_modules/
*.tgz
*.log

# lib/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
#
# DSH installs plugins with pnpm straight from GitHub (`github:lfapex/free2dsh`),
# so the bundle has to travel with the repo: with lib/ ignored, the installed
# package has no lib/index.js, `main` is unresolvable and the host reports
# "failed to import". cline2dsh hit this in v0.1.1 and fixed it the same way.
#
# Do NOT add a `prepare` (or any other install-time) script. Modern pnpm
# refuses to run build scripts for a git-hosted dependency unless the CONSUMER
# approves it, and an unapproved one fails the whole install with
# ERR_PNPM_GIT_DEP_PREPARE_NOT_ALLOWED — the profile's pnpm-workspace.yaml would
# need an allowBuilds entry pinning this repo, or the exact commit. With the
# bundle committed there is nothing to build at install time, so the plugin
# installs for anyone, on any pnpm, with no allowlist edit.
